# Category test68 History

See `CONTRIBUTING.rst` for details of **required** info/format for each entry,
which **must** added in reverse chronological order (newest at the top).
It must **not** be used as a substitute for writing good git commit messages!

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

## 2024-11-18 Gunter Folger (test68-V11-02-02)
- Changes for Windows: increase timelimit and for Continuous reduce 
   tests to run test only. 

## 2024-09-18 Gabriele Cosmo (test68-V11-02-01)
- Use default settings for random number generator.

## 2024-05-13 Ben Morgan (test68-V11-02-00)
- Escape backslash in paths on Windows to make them literal and avoid Python
  syntax warnings.

## 2023-10-25 Alberto Ribon (test68-V11-01-00)
- test68 : migrated the random number generator engine, from Ranlux64Engine
  to MixMaxRng.

## 2022-02-11 Gabriele Cosmo (test68-V11-00-01)
- Tst68DetectorConstruction: fixed compilation warning on Intel compiler
  for unused variable.

## 2021-12-10 Ben Morgan (test68-V11-00-00)
- Change to new Markdown History format.

